    "next_step": "Preregister a small eight-session fresh Slumbot greedy directional gate on the exact bundle SHA 78a23886 and Standard10 base SHA 91b0c587. Use raw hand JSONL for bb/100 and CI, audit session independence, and stop or scale based on external alignment with the internal positive learning curve."
